  com/armedia/acm/plugins/person. Relatedly and bindingly, the coverage agent
  preparation execution declares a destination file but no property name, so it
  communicates with the unit test runner through the default argLine property export;
  a literal argLine element in the unit test runner declaration would silently sever
  instrumentation and leave the coverage check goal evaluating an empty data set
  against its minimum line coverage ratio of 0.02, which is a false pass.
  Instrumentation must be verifiably live.

